#. module: ssi_school
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school.field_school_enrollment_fee_analysis__term_state
msgid ""
"Billing status of the payment term: Draft = enrollment still in draft/"
"confirm, Uninvoiced = enrollment open/done but no customer invoice yet, "
"Invoiced = customer invoice created, Manually Controlled = managed manually, "
"Cancelled = enrollment cancelled."
msgstr "Status penagihan termin pembayaran: Draf = pendaftaran masih draf/konfirmasi, Belum Difaktur = pendaftaran terbuka/selesai tetapi belum ada faktur pelanggan, Sudah Difaktur = faktur pelanggan sudah dibuat, Dikendalikan Manual = dikelola secara manual, Dibatalkan = pendaftaran dibatalkan."

#. module: ssi_school
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school.field_school_enrollment_payment_term__state
msgid ""
"Billing status: Draft = enrollment still in draft/confirm, Uninvoiced = "
"enrollment open/done but no customer invoice yet, Invoiced = customer "
"invoice created, Paid = the linked customer invoice is fully paid, Voided = "
"every detail line has had its amount moved to another payment term, Manually "
"Controlled = managed manually, Cancelled = enrollment cancelled."
msgstr "Status penagihan: Draf = pendaftaran masih draf/konfirmasi, Belum Difaktur = pendaftaran terbuka/selesai tetapi belum ada faktur pelanggan, Sudah Difaktur = faktur pelanggan sudah dibuat, Lunas = faktur pelanggan terkait sudah dibayar penuh, Dialihkan = seluruh baris detail sudah dialihkan jumlahnya ke termin pembayaran lain, Dikendalikan Manual = dikelola secara manual, Dibatalkan = pendaftaran dibatalkan."

